  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Achieving and Sustaining HIV/TB Epidemic Control in the Free state Province.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the activity is to support long, healthy lives for the population of Free State Province by achieving and sustaining HIV/TB epidemic control. USAID aims to reach this goal by achieving the following strategic objectives: Close the gaps to HIV/TB epidemic control; Sustain health gains through strengthened, improved, and resilient health systems; and Leverage community, civil society, traditional structures and private sector partnerships to improve and sustain service delivery and client outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
